a half percent.

8
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.660
Ages 20 to 29 are close behind at 29 and 29 and a half percent.

9
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:50.878
Then there's a big drop. Ages 30 to 39 are are 16.4%, 40 to 49 are 13.9%, and 50 and

